        "original_id": "1e3c0407-e327-574b-8ce5-43a125d039b9",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Terri Nunn, Sonya Scarlet, John Crawford, Virginia Macolino\n- Bands: Berlin, Theatres des Vampires\n- Albums: Information\n- Roles: singers, actress, lyricist, lead vocals, singer-songwriter\n\nFacts:\n- John Buckner Crawford was born on January 17, 1960.\n- Terri Kathleen Nunn was born on June 26, 1961, and she is an American singer and actress.\n- Sonya Scarlet was born on April 2, 1980, and she is the singer and lyricist of the Italian extreme gothic metal band Theatres des Vampires.\n- John Buckner Crawford is an American singer-songwriter whose work with Berlin was an essential part of the band's rise to fame in the early 1980s.\n- During the recording of the album Information by Berlin, Terri Nunn had temporarily left the band to pursue an acting career.\n- During the recording of Information by Berlin, Virginia Macolino performed the lead vocals.",
